n("n962","s035-05","formaliter non est in genere","la","textual","B: *formaliter est in genere* (om. *non*). This is against the conclusion, and A is right.","certain")
n("n963","s035-06","dicuntur a distinctis rebus","la","textual","B: *sumuntur a distinctis rebus*.","certain")
